<h3>四、Appeal Rights</h3>
<p>You may appeal this penalty if you have a <b>reasonable excuse</b> for late filing:</p>
<ul>
<li>Death of a partner or family member</li>
<li>Unexpected hospital stay</li>
<li>Computer failure when preparing the return</li>
<li>Fire or flood at business premises</li>
</ul>
<p>However, appeals take <b>4-6 months</b> to process and do not stop penalty accrual in the meantime. Payment first, then appeal for refund, is the fastest resolution.</p>

